---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Adopt a dog | Davis Dog Farm"
  description="See dogs available for adoption at Davis Dog Farm, our adoption process, and adoption fees."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Adopt a dog</h1>
      <p>These are the dogs currently looking for homes. Tap a dog to see their full profile, then send in an application. We don’t schedule meets until we have one.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://service.sheltermanager.com/asmservice?account=ah2716&amp;method=online_form_html&amp;formid=32">Start an adoption application</a>
        <a class="btn btn-plain" href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/19NL1eVUIidVtMqYAkH4f7_li4f0FR6-Gr8VGbCdXQTg/edit?usp=sharing">Read our adoption policies</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-white" aria-labelledby="dogs-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="dogs-heading">Available now</h2>
      <!-- This list comes live from the rescue's ShelterManager account.
           Add, update or remove a dog there and this page updates automatically. -->
      <div id="asm3-adoptables" class="adoptables">
        <p class="muted">Loading our dogs…</p>
      </div>
      <noscript>
        <p><a href="https://service.sheltermanager.com/asmservice?account=ah2716&amp;method=animal_view_adoptable_html">See the list of adoptable dogs</a></p>
      </noscript>
      <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:2rem">You can also find our dogs on <a href="https://www.petfinder.com/member/us/pa/grantville/the-davis-dog-farm-inc-pa1152/">Petfinder</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>The adoption process</h2>
      <p>Our application helps us get to know your family, your lifestyle and the pets you already have, so we can place each dog where they’ll do best. The dog you have in mind may not be the right fit for your home, and we’ll tell you honestly if so.</p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <h3>Apply</h3>
          <p>Fill out every question. If something doesn’t apply, write N/A. Incomplete applications can’t be considered, and applying doesn’t guarantee a match with a specific dog.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Reference check</h3>
          <p>We contact your veterinarian to confirm the pets in your home are up to date on shots and exams.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Meet and greet</h3>
          <p>We match you with a dog that fits your lifestyle and arrange a meet. Everyone in your household, including your dogs, needs to be there.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Home visit</h3>
          <p>The last step. We schedule a visit to your home before the adoption is final.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-white" id="fees">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <h2>Adoption fees</h2>
        <div class="table-scroll">
          <table class="fees">
            <tbody>
              <tr><th scope="row">Puppy (up to 1 year)</th><td>$400–$550</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Young adult (1–3 years)</th><td>$350–$400</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Adult (3–6 years)</th><td>$250–$350</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Senior (6+ years)</th><td>$100–$200</td></tr>
              <tr class="highlight"><th scope="row">Seniors for Seniors: dogs over 6, for approved adopters 60 and up</th><td>Free</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1rem">Exact fees depend on breed, health, temperament and other factors.</p>
        <p>We look at every application individually. If your situation doesn’t quite fit our policies, <a href="mailto:info@davisdogfarm.com">email us</a> and we’ll do our best to help.</p>
      </div>
      <img class="tall" src="/images/dog-bandana.jpg" alt="A young Malinois in a blue bandana sitting on a patio chair" width="900" height="1093" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-sky">
    <div class="wrap split flip">
      <div>
        <h2>Send a dog to school</h2>
        <p>Some dogs arrive with habits that make a new home harder. We work with local trainers on obedience and behavior so they can settle in and stay there.</p>
        <p>To give to training, donate through PayPal and add the note <strong>“training”</strong>.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-donate" href="https://www.paypal.com/donate?hosted_button_id=BNYCE2ETKYDN6">Donate to training</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img class="tall" src="/images/training-walk.jpg" alt="A trainer walking a small black dog on a leash indoors" width="900" height="1200" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </section>

<Fragment slot="scripts">
  <!-- The dog list is ShelterManager's embed: config first, then their script. -->
  <script is:inline src="/adoptables.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="https://service.sheltermanager.com/asmservice?account=ah2716&amp;method=animal_view_adoptable_js"></script>
</Fragment>
</Base>
